cl-c980d0f2\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">2,828,933</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d0fc\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">84.72</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d0fd\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">2,889,983</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d106\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">1.02</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-c980d0ea\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">Surgical</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d0f2\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">1,558,978</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d0fc\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">93.29</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d0fd\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">494,401</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d106\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">0.32</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"overflow-wrap:break-word;\"><td class=\"cl-c980d107\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">Other</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d110\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">45,739</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d11a\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">93.5</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d11b\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">12,809</span></p></td><td class=\"cl-c980d124\"><p class=\"cl-c9807206\"><span class=\"cl-c97b0e06\">0.28</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n```\n\n:::\n:::\n\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n![The average duration of delay for hospital admissions by month and specialty group.](mean-delayed-discharge_files/figure-html/fig-scale-specialty_group-1.png){#fig-scale-specialty_group width=672}\n:::\n:::\n\n\n### By admission method\n\n\n::: {.cell}\n\n:::\n\n\nThe average duration of delay in 2024/25 is higher for non elective admissions compared to elective admissions. Also, the average duration of delay is increasing over the months for non elective admissions but is more stable for non elective admissions. Elective admissions have a higher percentage of admissions discharged on the discharge ready date compared to non elective admissions.\n\n\n::: {#tbl-scale-pod .cell tbl-cap='The number of admissions in 2024/25, the total delay duration and the average duration of delay by month and point of delivery.'}\n::: {.cell-output-display}\n\n```{=html}\n<div class=\"tabwid\"><style>.cl-ca05b52e{}.cl-c9f9bc88{font-family:'Arial';font-size:12pt;font-weight:bold;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;}.cl-c9f9bc92{font-family:'Arial';font-size:12pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:normal;text-decoration:none;color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);background-color:transparent;}.cl-c9fe4ac8{margin:0;text-align:center;border-bottom: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-top: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-left: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-right: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);padding-bottom:2pt;padding-top:2pt;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;line-height: 1;background-color:transparent;}.cl-c9fe4adc{margin:0;text-align:left;border-bottom: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-top: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-left: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-right: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);padding-bottom:2pt;padding-top:2pt;padding-left:2pt;padding-right:2pt;line-height: 1;background-color:transparent;}.cl-c9feae14{width:1.471in;background-color:rgba(249, 191, 7, 1.00);vertical-align: middle;border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(102, 102, 102, 1.00);border-top: 1.5pt solid rgba(102, 102, 102, 1.00);border-left: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);border-right: 0 solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 1.00);margin-bottom:0;margin-top:0;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;}.cl-c9feae1e{width:1.971in;background-color:rgba(249, 191, 7, 1.00);vertical-align: middle;border-bottom: 1.5pt solid rgba(102, 102, 102, 1.00);border-top: 1.5pt solid rgba(102, 102, 102, 1.00);border-lef